answer:
Producer-consumer: producer adds items to buffer, consumer removes them — must avoid overflow and underflow.
Semaphores: mutex=1 (mutual exclusion), full=0 (items in buffer), empty=N (free slots).
Producer: wait(empty); wait(mutex); add_item(); signal(mutex); signal(full);
Consumer: wait(full); wait(mutex); remove_item(); signal(mutex); signal(empty);
